{"nodes": [{"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_parser_package_dcmjs_parser", "label": "@dcmjs/parser (vendored offset tokenizer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/parser-package.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The dicom-parser codebase vendored whole as a private, zero-dependency workspace package and deliberately diverged. No tag dictionary, no character-set handling: implicit-VR resolution is injectable via vrCallback and string accessors keep byte-identity latin semantics \u2014 dictionary/charset awareness live one layer up by design."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_parser_package_parsedicom", "label": "parseDicom (tokenizer entry point)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/parser-package.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_parser_package_element_model", "label": "Parser Element Model (offset spans, tagValue)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/parser-package.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every element is one object literal with all fields present (one hidden class \u2014 a deliberate perf property). tagValue, startOffset, and endOffset are dcmjs additions over upstream: the complete on-disk span is not recoverable after the fact and is the prerequisite for the passthrough writer."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_parser_package_dataset_accessors", "label": "Lazy DataSet Accessors (uint16/string/text/...)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/parser-package.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architectu